  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>AFP I</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-AFPI-a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Eight 1/8” (3.2 mm) wide tows</li>\n<li>Single Band Cut</li>\n<li>Six motion axes</li>\n<li>Passive “C” axis for compactor alignment</li>\n<li>Fanuc CNC controls</li>\n<li>Parts up to 10 ft (30.5 m) long x 5 ft (15.3 m) diameter</li>\n<li>Highly contoured parts with significant tow steering</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Automated Fiber Placement</h3><ul><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-fiber-placement-afp/afp-i/\">AFP I</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-fiber-placement-afp/afp-ii/\">AFP II</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-fiber-placement-afp/afp-iii/\">AFP III</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-AFPI-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-AFPI-a-300x171.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"171\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-AFPI-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-AFPI-b-300x218.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"218\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
